<title>BELGIUM: LUXEMBOURG BIL BANK APPOINTS NEW CEO.</title>
<headline>LUXEMBOURG BIL BANK APPOINTS NEW CEO.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banque Internationale a Luxembourg (BIL) said it appointed Andre Roelants as its new chief executive.</p>
<p>The board of directors also named Roelants as its chairman. The position of vice-president, which was held by Roelants, will not be filled.</p>
<p>Jean Krier who handed in his resignation as chief executive on Tuesday, remains director and will represent BIL in the boards of Luxair, Luxembourg bourse and Banque Bruxelles Lambert (BBL) .</p>
<p>-- Brussels newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
